# Generated by `yarn build` in packages/teieditor and shipped via package.json
# "files". prepublishOnly (`yarn clean && yarn build`) regenerates them, so the
# published tarball is always fresh. Tracking them meant a commit that edited
# src/registry without rebuilding would ship a scaffold that no longer matched
# the source.
packages/teieditor/registry/
packages/teieditor/r/
packages/teieditor/registry.json
